"A picture is worth a thousand words" is what the popular saying goes, a phrase that perfectly sums up everything that a simple image can transmit. For each person it can mean something different, because emotions are not the same for all people.
What is clear is that there is no insignificant image. All images contain something of the one who created them, whether through a photograph or an illustration, each one contains a part of the soul of the one who created it and that, ultimately, is what is transmitted to the eyes of the observer.
In the same way that art lovers enjoy observing a painting for hours, analyzing each stroke, each color, each detail expressed in the work, in the images that we will select for you you can find details that only you will understand. That is, other people may not see the same thing as you, but that is the beauty of art, that each one enjoys and interprets it in a different way.
Who knows, maybe in one of those photographs you can find inspiration you need to change course. Or maybe you decide to take that path that scares you so much, or you surprise yourself sending a message to that person with whom you do not decide to talk.
