The contributions of Galileo Galilei they were really vital for the development of physics, astronomy and science in general; since even this is considered the father of science, which according to studies was a physicist, engineer, mathematician, astronomer and philosopher who was born in Italy on February 15, 1564.
Galileo contributed to the Copernican theory (Planets revolve around the sun) the discoveries offered by his newly improved telescope, such as the observations he made of the Moon, Jupiter, Venus, and even the sun. What helped him to create a text that explained how the universe worked and what was the place of the earth in it.
One of the contributions of Galileo Galilei Most notable was his attitude towards the Catholic Church of wanting to go one step further and show that the model or theory that was had about the Universe was not correct, no matter how much it would cost.
The sidereal messenger it is about the discoveries the scientist made about the moon.
The book of speech about things that float on water, Rather, it consisted of an investigation that sought to verify Aristotle's theory, which was true.
Last Two new sciences aimed to make a summary about the sciences of motion and force, which were part of the Galileo Galilei's contributions to physics.
Newton's first law of motion was the object of study by Galileo, who understood that bodies can accelerate at the same rate regardless of their mass or size; so the movement was only about the speed and direction of a body.
Stress is a natural state of the body, a way to stay alert to situations that require your full attention. However, when stress persists after said action ends, it can become chronic.
1.2 Puzzles and puzzles
Discover these games to relax, with which you can free your mind from everything that does not allow you to disconnect from daily problems. Activities that you can even share with children, your friends or family.
Sculpting with clay is also among the best games to relax. You only need a little clay or modeling paste, it is easy to find, an inexpensive product and very simple to use.
Lego and building blocks aren't just for kids, in fact, there are almost more adult fans than little ones. These construction games are some of the best relaxation games to be found and there are options for all tastes.
It will take just a few minutes each day, but it will allow you to enjoy how a simple seed transforms into something full of life. And if this botany interests you, go ahead and discover the fascinating world of bonsai.
Although mobile devices are not the best option when you want to disconnect from the worries of life, there is no doubt that it is the fastest way to find games with which to release tension. The offer in games is very wide, although in many cases they are very fast animations, changes in light and color that end up making you more nervous than you were.
Relaxation games can be alone, but if they are in company, in addition to achieving the goal of releasing stress, you can enjoy some time in good company. Because there is no better way to relax than with a good session of laughter and fun.
