What is education and why is it important?
"Education does not change the world, it changes the people who are going to change the world" Paulo Freire. Without education there is no future, the hope of a better, more sustainable, supportive and fair world for everyone, it depends on the education they receive the people who now inhabit it.
You are never too old to learn new things And it is never too late to improve, to invest time, effort and money in education and personal growth. But it is also very important to accept that you yourself deserve that investment, because many times you think so much about others that you forget to take care of yourself.
Education should be considered a life project, because always, at any time along the way, you can train and learn new things. What's more, improving your training will allow you to renew yourself, recycle your knowledge and prepare yourself to develop professionally in a field that perhaps can give you that happiness that is not always present.
Because invest in you, your education and your training, it is not only necessary, but it is fundamental for your own personal development. And it should not be a simple economic investment, since the most important investment you can make for yourself and for your future is your personal dedication.
