Solar Street Light
In recent years, with the country's strong support for environmental protection industry, thesolar street lightindustry is developing faster and faster, along with the development of more and more solar street light products on the market, but more and more problems are derived, such as uneven illumination, unreasonable light distribution, etc.. In fact, a good solar street light also has its own set of criteria for judging, as follows.
High luminous efficiency: high brightness at the same time, power consumption can not be high, so the light source must be high light efficiency, this specific value is increased according to the LED luminous efficiency. At present, the overall luminous efficacy of 160lm/W or more is considered relatively high, so in this year we set him at 160lm/W.
Low cost: to achieve perfection can not just consider the high configuration, must be taken cost-effective, high performance while controlling the cost, so that this set of solar street light selling price in the market price ± 10% or less.
Long life: With the development of lithium batteries, the service life of the whole set of solar street lights is no longer limited by the short life of 2-5 years of lead-acid batteries, the quality of lithium batteries is able to extend the life of the whole light to more than 10 years. Therefore, taking into account the long-term use of lights and maintenance costs, the whole system of 10 years of life is also the perfect solar street light has some hard indicators.
