Is it necessary to enter at the preparatory faculty if I want to study in English?
Admission to the university will be after your interview in English.
Is education carried out together with Ukrainian students in the same groups or separately for foreign students?
While studying Russian at preparatory faculty students attend classes only for foreigners.
During the first year course at university and at other courses, the education is possible both in groups for foreign students and in groups with Ukrainian students.
