Mobile technology has advanced rapidly in recent years, so much so that we have terminals capable of doing any task quickly. With the smartphone there are already many thousands of people who use it for everything, including making professional logos with them in a few screen clicks.
A logo comes to act as part of the brand, whether on a page, company or if you want to create a personal one for a family member, friend or client. Get to know the best applications to create logos on Android, all of them are free tools, not requiring any kind of outlay.
7 Logo Designer
It is one of the applications that have been gaining respect thanks to the many options it offers us. Canva is an all-rounder when it comes to creating, whether it's a logo, a banner or making a collage, among other things.
It has thousands of templates, many of them are free, but some of them are paid, unlockable if you get the application's Pro account for a few euros. Canva is one of the most downloaded apps on the Play Store when it comes to logo creation apps, with over 100 million downloads.
It has been created to make logos in a few steps, being one of the so-called easy ones thanks to the interface, in addition the handling is one of the simplest. Logo Maker Plus gives those who install it thousands of graphic elements, giving developers many creation options.
With four or five steps the DesignEvo application is able to create a logo or brand image. With more than 3.500 templates, the app has numerous sources, to which it adds graphic elements that allow each of the jobs to be completed.
DesignEvo is perfect if you want to create your company logo, a logo for a web page, to decorate an area, among other things. Add more than 100 different fonts, saving projects in high quality with output in JPG and PNG, both normal and transparent.
Once you open it, it shows a lot of logo prototypes, all of them created by designed and editable by users who have the application installed on their device. The designs are of high quality, once created they can be exported to formats such as JPG and PNG (the last one is the export in high quality).
The app has been downloaded by more than 5 million people.
