Communiame is the previous name that Biwenger received, the fantasy that is an alternative to Comunio, which has been widely accepted by the public. The name it receives has nothing to do with it, it is designed so that the community can communicate directly, in addition to being able to compete with each other in different leagues.
Many people even create their own Comuniame competition, with really competitive templates and all this with closed budgets for each component. Communicate is the name that Biwenger receives, and that is usually adding points – in negative or positive – for the Madrid newspaper AS, medium that finally gives support.
The chroniclers will give each footballer a base, which may be negative or positive, all depending on the performance within the match. Negatives will subtract from the template at the endTherefore, it is best to have points in order to lead the final classification of the week.
Every day you must check if that eleven can have possibilities, so having good reserves is worth a lot if you want to give others a chance. Having at least 15 players will make you more competitive, in addition to giving you points for all the available players you have.
A few years ago the name of Comuniame changed to Biwenger, the last one is the one that uses the platform, all after an expansion decision. Biwenger is easier when it comes to pronouncing, when searching, and it was an important step, so much so that it reached many millions of people.
The fundamental basis is not to leave any position empty, you will be penalized with -4 points, so it is best to take a look at it during the week. Biwenger, before Comuniame, will close eleven from Fridays, when the football day begins, so pay attention to those days hours before it starts.
The bench cannot exceed four players, who will be a substitute goalkeeper, a defender, a midfielder and a forward, four important positions. The player has to find some players that do not cost too much and to be able to complete the 15 soccer players that it asks for.
If you are one of those who do not add up, the best thing is to move the market, get quality players if you have any points left, in addition to changing someone if they play good games. His thing is always to take a look at the matches, as well as the scorers, mid-level players sometimes stand out in matches.
In "Team" you can change players, choose the position you want to change, choose one of the many players, but first check how much money you have left. When you click on a player on the field, several players will appear, you have the option to change for another sticker with which to add points Communicate.
