If you have ever considered it, or you have received an "indecent proposal", perhaps what we tell you will surprise you.
That is to say, that other person commissions this person to write something for him (a novel, a story, an article...) knowing that he will never be able to reveal his authorship and taking all the credit for that other person who will be the one to sign as if I would have written.
Although many think that they are only used to write books, the truth is that you can also order biographies, speeches, articles... any text in which one person writes on behalf of another. Now this is not so "humiliating".
Of course, you must bear in mind that that ghostwriter has to take the deal, and voluntarily assign their authorship. That doesn't mean "free".
With all of the above said, there is no doubt that we can glean some important clues that characterize a ghostwriter. They are between them:
Unless another agreement is reached with the person who hires him, in principle the name that will be accompanied by that document will be that of the buyer, not that of the seller ("black"). In fact, sometimes it is common for the author himself to appear in the book, not as a writer, but as a copy editor.
How to be a ghostwriter Has the bug bit you and have you seen that It can be a job opportunity as a writer?
When you go to some famous person or writer offering yourself, the most normal thing is that they reject you, either because they have not considered any book, because it seems to them an offense (as if they did not know how to write) or for any other reason.
It is not the same that it is your first order to that it is number one hundred. When you are already specialized, your price goes up.
Because sometimes many choose a high number when they know that it is a book for a person who is going to make it viral a lot, and that way they make sure they have at least a pinch of the fame that book could get.
